@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName "Helvetica"
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam wrapWidth 220
skinparam ranksep 50
actor "1,000,000 fans\nwaiting" as F
cloud "CDN, ~200 edge locations" as CDN #EAF1FB
node "Waiting room + Redis" as WR #F7F9FC
actor "~10,000 fans\nshopping at once" as S
node "Seat-map service\n+ Redis snapshot" as MAP #F7F9FC
node "Inventory service" as INV #F7F9FC
database "PostgreSQL\n(1 primary for this event)" as DB #DFF1E4
node "Order service" as ORD #F7F9FC
cloud "PSP" as PSP #FFF3D1
F -down-> CDN : <b>~100,000 req/s</b>\nqueue-state polls
CDN -down-> WR : <b><= ~200 req/s</b>\n1 per edge per second
F -right-> WR : joins: <b>~50,000/s</b> worst case\n(~600/s with a 30-min lobby)
WR -down-> S : admitted: <b>~33 fans/s</b>
S -down-> MAP : <b>~5,000 req/s</b>\nRedis + 304s, never the DB
S -down-> INV : <b>50-500 holds/s</b>
INV -down-> DB : same, as transactions
S -down-> ORD : <b>~25 orders/s</b>
ORD -right-> PSP : 25 authorizations/s,\n250 in flight
@enduml
